 You are as good as Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big hero and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big hero and a hero and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Desdemona.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Miranda]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Viola and Viola.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big big hero and a hero and the product of Hamlet and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big hero.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Viola]
Prospero:
 You are as good as Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big hero and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big hero and a hero and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Portia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
