[Enter Prospero and Miranda]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Viola and Viola.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big big hero and a hero and the product of Juliet and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the sum of a big hero and a hero.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
