Prospero:
 You are as good as Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big hero and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big hero and a hero and Lady Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Miranda]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Viola and Viola.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big big hero and a hero and the product of Othello and Lady Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the sum of a big big hero and a hero.
